            <div xml:id="d513">

                <pb facs="0687" n="563" sameAs="frus:frus1921v01/pg563"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.113/207: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Ambassador in Italy</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Child</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-12-23T18:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">December 23,
                                1921—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>203. Your 261 December 17, 2 p.m.</p>
                <p>You may separately but simultaneously with your British, French and Japanese
                    colleagues make representations suggested in your 258 December 13, 1 p.m.,
                    protesting to Italian Government against the <pb facs="0688" n="564"
                        xml:id="pg564"/> handing over to the Military Governor of Chihli Province
                    arms which have been stored in Italian Barracks at Shanhaikuan.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
